      "snippet": "Root cause of January 2023 condenser backpressure degradation confirmed as tube fouling due to biological growth in circulating water system. Hotwell dissolved oxygen was within normal limits during that event at 7.2 ppb \u2014 confirming tube fouling rather than air in-leakage as the mechanism. Corrective actions: biocide treatment, tube cleaning, enhanced CW monitoring. Analyst note: DO was normal in the 2023 event, which distinguishes it from any future event showing DO elevation. The presence of elevated DO in a current event changes the causal hypothesis from fouling to air in-leakage.",
